// Canonical, deterministic, conservative EffectInfo inference and call-graph effect summary
// propagation over MIR/OptIR (T602 / E15.1).
// Implements SPEC-70 §7.3-7.4 (AXS-OPT-023, AXS-OPT-024, AXS-OPT-044,
// REQ-OPT-321, REQ-OPT-348, REQ-OPT-349, REQ-OPT-393..398, REQ-VER-027).
module compiler.opt.effects

